            "heading": "When can I have it?",
            "show_when": "coming_soon",
            "text": "<p>Not yet. The first edition is being prepared: 100 copies in English, 100 in Slovak.</p><p>There’s no date yet, and we won’t make one up. Leave your email above and you’ll get one message when it’s ready.</p>",
            "secondary": true
