        "acc_read": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to read",
            "show_when": "always",
            "text": "<p>You don’t need to know tarot. It works the same whether this is your first deck or you read every day.</p><p>Use any spread you already know. Two come with the deck. Card of the day: draw one in the morning, keep it with you or stand it somewhere you’ll see it, and let it work on you all day. Reading of consciousness: the longer one, in three steps — what to understand, what to accept, what to transform.</p>",
            "secondary": true
          }
        },
        "acc_gift": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "As a gift",
            "show_when": "always",
            "text": "<p>A present for someone close: your partner, a friend, your mum.</p><p>Original illustrations, a first edition of 100 copies per language, and something they’ve almost certainly never been given before. Pick the edition in the language they read. Want it sent straight to them? Put their address in as the delivery address at checkout.</p>",
            "secondary": true
          }
        },
        "acc_walter": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "About Walter",
            "show_when": "always",
            "text": "<p>Walter Ihring draws humour and caricature. The drawings travel to exhibitions abroad and every now and then come home with an award.</p><p>In 2015 came Walterin Bratislava, a city told in comics. The tarot is the first deck.</p>",
            "secondary": true
          }
        },
